edgetam-coreml
Core ML conversion of EdgeTAM.

This repository converts and redistributes model weights from EdgeTAM
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/EdgeTAM, commit 7711e012a30a2402c4eaab637bdb00a521302c91),
Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).
EdgeTAM builds on SAM 2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2), also Apache-2.0, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms,
Inc. and affiliates.

The converted .mlpackage files are a derivative work of the EdgeTAM checkpoint: the network is re-expressed for
Core ML (fixed rotary tables, branch-free prompt handling, fp16) and its weights are otherwise unchanged unless a
release notes a quantized variant. Keep this NOTICE and LICENSE with any copy of the packages.
